+# Index — one line per doc: what it is, what it has authority over, its status
+
+The map of `docs/`. Every file here appears once. Three shelves: the **front path** (`docs/` top level — current documents you may need to act on), **reference** (still governs, but you consult it rather than start there), and **archive** (superseded or closed; retained, never updated). `deployments/` holds per-deployment host facts; `evidence/` holds frozen experiment records. A doc's own `**Status:**` header is authoritative for its state; this file is the map, not a status board.
+
+## docs/ — the front path (current)
+
+- omegahive_design_1_1.md — THE implementation design against the 1.1 spec (rev 6, Jul 6 2026): assumptions, architecture, per-component decisions, declared divergences, the stage plan. Authority: architecture, for the whole system. **Current — authoritative; start here.**
+- omegahive_test_plan.md — the test & evaluation plan (rev 6, Jul 6 2026): metrics catalog, suite definitions, gates, decision rules. Authority: normative for everything the design doc's §8 only summarizes. **Current.**
+- omegahive_deployment_spec.md — deployment & operations spec (v2+): repo hygiene, the OmegaClaw fork program, topology and provenance, secrets, operating procedures. Authority: deployment policy, all deployments. **Current** — except §7 (Beastie bring-up), a completed milestone whose result is the deployment #0 record.
+- omegahive_recovery_runbook.md — operator procedures: out-of-band recovery, backup, restore, drain-before-migrate, environment change. Authority: what the operator executes on a live host. **Current — operating procedure.**
+- omegahive_hive_native_ops.md — hive-native operations MVP (v0.2): the project runs itself on the hive; tiers, preconditions, granularity and steering principles. Authority: controlling spec for tier-1 operations. **Current.**
+- omegahive_session_agents.md — how Claude Code / Codex CLI participate as workers: the two wake patterns, the instrumentation ladder, the economics. Authority: rationale only — the workspace's `WORKER.md` is the operating protocol. **Current.**
+- omegahive_ui_spec.md — the operator-facing web UI spec. Authority: controlling for what the UI does. **Current — v0.1 shipped** (`src/omegahive/ui/`); §4 write path and §6 growth seams are still design-ahead.
+- omegahive_hive_user_migration.md — the procedure for moving the stack onto a dedicated `hive` unix account (Phase 2 identity gate, item 2). Authority: the migration itself. **Current — Parts A–C executed Jul 27 2026; Part D (cutover) written and deliberately unexecuted**, so this is open work, not history.
+- omegahive_c2_battery_spec.md — build spec for the C2 coordinator-qualification battery (v1.1): can a given model drive an agent loop with emission discipline. Authority: the `qual/` battery's semantics and its scoring bars. **Current** (its stage-2 framing is superseded by the stage-2 verdict; the battery itself lives on as a qualification instrument).
+- omegahive_o2_fork_patches.md — self-contained work order: the OmegaClaw fork patch set (board channel adapter, board-op skill, usage logging). Authority: none standing — the deployment spec §3 is the normative home for the patch list. **Executed** (the hive image is built); kept as the operational detail behind those patches.
+- omegahive_v0b_order.md — self-contained work order: hive-image board-binding qualification as a gate for stage 3. Authority: that run's pass bars. **Work order, on the front path** — not triaged by the Jul 28 2026 docs pass.
+- omegahive_c2_v0a_v2_order.md — self-contained work order: the C2 v0a v2 experiment (the F1–F6 dispositions from the v0a-r1 validity review). Authority: that experiment's design. **Work order, on the front path** — not triaged by the Jul 28 2026 docs pass.
+- omegahive_v3_kb_persona_brief.md — self-contained work order: authoring the stage-2 persona, op-reference sheet, and coordination KB (hash-pinned experiment inputs). Authority: those artifacts' content rules. **Work order, on the front path** — not triaged by the Jul 28 2026 docs pass.
+- omegahive_stage2_fixes_A1-A4.md — self-contained work order: post-audit fixes to the k-joins/prune substrate and ladder harness (refs as of `3d6e165`). Authority: none standing — the code carries the fixes. **Work order, on the front path** — not triaged by the Jul 28 2026 docs pass.
+- omegahive_port_fixes_D1-D5.md — self-contained work order: post-audit fixes to the port build (refs as of `ce869d9`), D1 the stranded-transaction bug. Authority: none standing — the code carries the fixes. **Work order, on the front path** — not triaged by the Jul 28 2026 docs pass.
+- omegahive_v3_fixes_B1-B6.md — self-contained work order: V3 review fixes gating the grid freeze (catalog repoint, CI assertions, rejection code). Authority: none standing — the code carries the fixes. **Work order, on the front path** — not triaged by the Jul 28 2026 docs pass.
+- INDEX.md — this map.
