+## docs/reference/ — normative-or-historical sources; consult, don't start here
+
+- reference/README.md — the two-line convention note for this directory.
+- omegahive_spec_1_1.md — text-faithful conversion of Ben Goertzel's OmegaHive 1.1 PDF. Authority: **upstream source** — normative for vocabulary and the component set; never amended here, and the design doc's declared divergences win over it. **Reference source.**
+- omegahive_port_spec.md — the port milestone build spec (rev 3). Authority: **semantics normative** — the port surface, the idempotency key rule, and the proof obligations the code implements; the build narrative is historical (shipped at `ce869d9`, fixes D1–D5 folded). **Reference — shipped build spec.**
