+- omegahive_interop_durability_notes.md — MCP/A2A interop and durable-execution (Temporal/DBOS) options at the seams already designed. **Frozen — options, not decisions.**
+- omegahive_vs_qwestor_cascade.md — comparison against the Qwestor research cascade: different layers, not competing designs. **Frozen.**
+- omegahive_deferred_capability_coordination.md — capability-aware coordination (competence, capacity, routing), cut from M5 by red-team panel and preserved with the panel's findings. **Deferred design — not to build yet.**
