+- omegahive_docs_audit.md — the Jun 29 2026 docs audit that preceded the pivot. **Archived — historical snapshot.**
+- omegahive_v0_spec.md — the v0 coordination-prototype spec (Regime A, all-stub). **Archived — simulation era.**
